            "created_at": "2025-07-21T02:23:26.048511+00:00",
            "notes": "[Cross-Orbal](item_e567bb63-527f-4c72-8ba1-dc59be1a0dc1) is such a useful item. It's helpful in the first round to start generating cash. Even though this is not an orb build, the utility of being able to pump out both orbs at the same time is great. Especially as this build is a gradual ramp up. \n\nThe real benefit to Cross-orbal over the other orb powers is when flanking later once you have [Chain Grasp](item_17b85f3e-1b10-410d-8e02-c7ff61f502a0). Your heal orb will offer you survivability, while the damage orb adds pressure.  \n\nThe greens aren't extremely important here. Weapon power, speed, and life steal are all good. [Armored Vest](item_358361e2-59be-4c81-b221-8a87f37809e6) is always a good choice for round 1.",
