            "cash_earned": 0,
            "created_at": "2025-07-21T02:23:26.595485+00:00",
            "notes": "[Ethereal Excision](item_a2359da3-1aa5-406f-a82f-4a0bd66266ac)  gives Moira the ability to critical hit. Things will start melting faster now, just remember to aim your crosshair at heads. \n\nYou could opt to get [Chain Grasp](item_17b85f3e-1b10-410d-8e02-c7ff61f502a0) first and Ethereal Excision at round 5. I prefer waiting for Chain Grasp for when your power is a little higher. But if you feel like you need it sooner it'll be fine. \n\n[Smart Orbs](item_47f5985c-9b63-40d2-938b-63a22154b9be) is a really good choice. You're orbs aren't very powerful, so you want to get as much as you can out of them.\n\n[Subatomic Splitter](item_a5df2382-7249-43ad-b891-b8e465e9744e)  is very good to help you keep your distance and catch any fliers. You want it as soon as you can, but don't sacrifice your weapon power/attack speed for it just yet.",
