            "created_at": "2025-07-21T02:23:26.906208+00:00",
            "notes": "Keep buffing your weapon power and attack speed.\n\nBy now you should have plenty of money to play around with customizing this build to what you need.\n\nIf you need help staying alive, [Vital-E-Tee](item_b92e6f1d-3aac-4eec-b027-00c8e1529016) is always solid. Be sure to use the extra range you have to your advantage. And [Smart Orbs](item_47f5985c-9b63-40d2-938b-63a22154b9be) makes heal orbs stick to you if you send it out when damaged. \n\n[El-sa'ka Supressor](item_b4298dd9-9b93-461f-a2e0-843402667100) helps your dueling potential with the heal reduction property.  [Cybervenom](item_210a8582-91ec-4cf3-968a-a443f3a0c505) and  [Liquid Nitrogen](item_a8d99526-05a3-4405-babb-b025479b1b98)  are less beneficial because of being attached to the ability stat.",
