            "created_at": "2025-07-21T02:23:27.206122+00:00",
            "notes": "[Chain Grasp](item_17b85f3e-1b10-410d-8e02-c7ff61f502a0) gives you another nice bump in power. \n\nYou should know what to do now. Aim for squishies that are clumped together. Don't forget to toss out orbs to activate chain grasp. \n\nSell your weaker items as needed to afford stronger items. Unless there is an effect you really need, don't make yourself weaker to afford a purple. For strict weapon power/attack speed increase they are worse value for the money.",
